:: Rydan [character check] {"position":"250,100","size":"100,100"}
Locked from earlier decisions (keep or cut each):
- Name Rydan (after the palace Raydan).
- Carries his grandfather's jambiyah; the hilt is an heirloom with 3 stone slots that open as the story goes on.
- One prosthetic arm; tech moves cost SP.
- Fights alone; story allies come in as call-in assists.

Still open: who is he, what does he want, what stands in his way?


:: The world [place check] {"position":"400,100","size":"100,100"}
Locked from earlier decisions (keep or cut each):
- A cyberpunk Sana'a, Yemen; old city at night, a megacity on the horizon.
- Real places: Souq al-Milh, al-Saila, Bab al-Yaman, Zubairi, Haddah, Bayt Baws.
- Signs in the world are written in Musnad only.
- The save spot is a sabil fountain.
- Money: the riyal.

The old story (the Concession, the water, Idris Qadi, Hamoud, Abu Nabil) is cut.


:: Open questions [question idea] {"position":"550,100","size":"100,100"}
- What is the story about, in one line?
- What does the title "Neon Glitch" mean in the story?
- Who is the enemy?
- How does the story end?
- Who are Rydan's call-in allies?


:: Start screen [scene ch0 locked] {"position":"100,300","size":"100,100"}
Menu -> qamariya -> pick hero (Rydan only for now) -> brief + Normal/Hard -> reaction -> the game.
The clips play as video with the UI on top.

[[Rooftop fight]]


:: Rooftop fight [scene ch1 idea] {"position":"250,300","size":"100,100"}
The first thing we build: one rooftop, one fight, the HUD.

Whose rooftop is it, who does Rydan fight, and why?

